WEBVTT

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:04.420
That attack is the best you can do?

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.750
I knew you'd be defeated!

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.560
I'll be defeated?

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:17.600
It's now Revolver's turn.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.460
Stay calm, Takeru.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:23.170
Revolver never shows false confidence.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:26.440
Soulburner knows that.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:29.150
That's not good enough to defeat me.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:34.250
It's fitting that you'll 
be stuck here forever.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:40.500
You lost your Fire Ignis, 
which was your compass.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.190
You're a lost ship wandering the same area.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:47.190
That's what I'll make you realize!

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.660
My turn!  I draw!

00:00:52.430 --> 00:01:01.700
calling & feeling  I take your 
thoughts to heart  VRAINS

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:29.660
The data storm grazes my cheek, 
so I can't open my eyes

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:39.610
What are we trying to find?  
Where are we trying to go?

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:44.850
I won't make anyone sad anymore

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:53.390
I'll retrieve you  Let's go and look ahead

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:58.530
By meeting you, the world is in color

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:04.200
I'll protect you with an unseen bond

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:08.500
calling  With invisible wings

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:19.110
Destroy the dark and weakness within me

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:28.960
I activate the spell card, 
Final Offguard from my hand!

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:32.730
If I have less LP than you...

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:37.470
...and you're the only one with a monster 
Special Summoned from the Extra Deck...

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:39.440
...I draw two cards.

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:43.640
I activate the Field Spell, 
Boot Sector Launch's effect!

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:47.110
Come, Anesthrokket Dragon!

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.850
I activate the Equip Spell, 
Borrel Regenerator!

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:57.820
I Special Summon Silverrokket Dragon from 
the graveyard and equip it with this card.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:01.730
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Squib Draw!

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:05.640
I destroy Silverrokket and draw two cards.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:09.270
Borrel Regenerator's effect now 
activates from the graveyard.

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:11.240
I draw one card!

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:13.940
Sheesh.  He's drawing a lot.

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:20.250
When there's a Rokket monster, I Special 
Summon Absorouter Dragon from my hand!

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:28.890
I use Anesthrokket and Absorouter 
Dragon to Link Summon!

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:32.560
Link 2 Quadborrel Dragon!

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:36.030
Absorouter's effect activates 
from the graveyard!

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:39.500
I add a Rokket monster 
from my deck to my hand.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:43.560
I activate the spell card, 
Borrel Half Replace!

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:48.540
I Special Summon a Borrel from my 
Extra Deck with the same number

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:51.670
of Link Markers as the 
Borreload in my graveyard.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:54.680
Come, Borrelsword Dragon!

00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:04.190
But the Special Summoned monster has its 
effects negated, and its ATK are halved.

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:08.160
I activate Borrel Half Replace's 
effect from my graveyard!

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:11.980
By banishing this card and 
two Rokket monsters...

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:17.760
...I Special Summon a Link 2 
Dark monster from my Extra Deck

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:20.730
next to Borrelsword's link and 
treat it as a Link Summon!

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:24.600
Link 2 Booster Dragon!

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:27.480
Quadborrel's effect activates!

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:31.940
I can discard a card to destroy a monster!

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:38.560
But when Violet Chimera is equipped with 
Salamangreat Kernel, effects can't destroy it!

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:41.680
I destroy Borrelsword!

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:49.290
Then I can Special Summon Rokkets 
from my hand or graveyard,

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:51.950
up to the number of Link Markers it had.

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:57.040
Resurrect, Magnarokket and Rokket Recharger!

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:59.780
Booster Dragon's effect activates!

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:04.280
One monster gains 500 ATK and DEF!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.990
I select Magnarokket!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:10.600
Magnarokket's effect now activates!

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:14.490
It destroys itself and sends 
a monster to the graveyard.

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:17.960
I select Violet Chimera!

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:24.040
Oh my.  Magna's graveyard-sending 
effect is powerful.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:27.310
He's in trouble if Violet Chimera is gone.

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:35.050
He was always planning to use 
Quadborrel to destroy Magnarokket!

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:38.020
But Salamangreat Kernel's effect!

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:44.990
When Violet Chimera is equipped with this 
card, non-Link Monster effects can't affect it!

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:48.980
Then I'll activate the 
spell card, Link Burst!

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:54.730
I destroy my Link Monster and 
your monster to draw one card.

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:59.840
I destroy Booster Dragon and Violet Chimera!

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.480
Salamangreat Kernel's effect!

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.080
Instead of destroying the equipped monster...

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:11.680
...I return a Link 2 or higher Salamangreat 
in my graveyard to my Extra Deck!

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.850
Ah.  So you stopped that too.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:17.860
That's not all.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:23.110
can't be destroyed in battle 
or by effects that turn!

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:30.470
Violet Chimera is now unaffected by non-Link 
Monsters' effects and can't be destroyed.

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:35.940
Your strategy made my Violet 
Chimera's defense stronger!

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:41.950
That's be true if my goal was 
to use Link Burst to destroy it.

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:43.280
What?

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:47.160
The destroyed Booster 
Dragon's effect activates!

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.940
I Special Summon Borreload from my graveyard!

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:56.160
Hey, he resurrected Borreload.

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:59.160
Then Recharger's effect activates!

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:07.800
By sending it to the graveyard, I Special 
Summon a non-Booster Dark monster from my graveyard.

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.040
Resurrect, Quadborrel!

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:14.250
Then I summon Rokket Synchron 
and activate its effect!

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:19.980
I negate Absorouter's effects to Special 
Summon it from the graveyard in defense position!

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:28.280
Level 1 Rokket Synchron tunes 
Level 7 Absorouter Dragon!

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:35.040
Heroic dragon!

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:39.070
Fire by transforming your 
ferocious fangs into bullets!

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:40.770
Synchro Summon!

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:47.980
Appear!  Level 8 Borreload Savage Dragon!

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:50.760
Savage Dragon's effect activates!

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:55.720
When it's Synchro Summoned, it equip 
a Link Monster from my graveyard.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:08:00.680
Then I place a Borrel Counter for 
every one of its Link Markers.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:03.930
It equips Borrelsword from my graveyard.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:16.180
And it gains ATK equal to half the 
equipped monster's original ATK.

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:21.710
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up my path!

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:26.550
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Effect Monsters!

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:28.320
Link Summon!

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:33.710
From the eternal creation of the 
world, zero resurrects endlessly!

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:39.700
Appear, Link 4 Topologic Zeroboros!

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.900
A new Topologic.

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:44.900
Not bad, Revolver.

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:47.590
He brought out a new monster.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.570
Zeroboros's effect!

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:55.310
It gains 200 ATK for every banished card!

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:58.050
There are four banished cards.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:03.020
So Zeroboros gains 800 ATK!

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:06.460
Revolver has three ace monsters.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:08.190
This is...

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:09.690
Battle!

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:13.780
Borreload attacks Violet Chimera!

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:22.710
Borreload's effect activates!

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:24.780
Anti Enemy Varrett!

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:33.840
I activate the trap card, 
Salamangreat Geyser!

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:37.040
I return a Salamangreat in my 
graveyard to my Extra Deck-

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:38.400
I won't let you!

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:40.790
Savage Dragon's effect activates!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:45.320
By using a counter, Geyser's 
activation is negated!

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.280
Continue the attack!

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:51.020
Go, Borreload!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.930
Thunder Varrel Cannon!

00:09:53.930 --> 00:09:59.240
Due to Salamangreat Kernel's effect, 
Violet Chimera isn't destroyed!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.710
But you still take damage!

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:10.420
Next, Savage Dragon attacks Violet Chimera!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:13.300
Thunderclap Varrel Fire!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:16.010
Violet Chimera's effect activates!

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.420
Its ATK are doubled!

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:30.440
It's not over!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:32.480
So you survived.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.160
The next battle!

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:37.890
Final Disorder Code!

00:10:37.890 --> 00:10:41.060
Violet Chimera's effect activates!

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:56.950
Revolver's attack is now over.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:59.180
Way to survive, Takeru!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.780
I end my turn.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:06.510
Not bad, Soulburner.

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:11.480
I survived!  And I'll burn you up next turn!

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:15.200
Don't be impatient.  It's not over yet.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:19.430
The turn is over, so what can you do?

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:27.170
When my turn ends, due to Magnarokket's 
effect, I Special Summon Autorokket from my deck.

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:31.050
And Zeroboros's effect activates!

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:38.260
When a monster is Special Summoned next to 
its link, all cards on the field are banished!

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.100
What?

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:46.220
All cards are banished?

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.090
Asura Enigma!

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:56.090
Impressive, Revolver.

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:59.440
You're no ordinary duelist.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.240
Too bad.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:07.390
You hoped to defeat me next 
turn, but I blew out your flame.

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:10.820
He's always unpredictable.

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:17.690
It's annoying, but he's the 
greatest duelist I've ever faced.

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:20.040
I have 700 LP.

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:22.160
Is this the end?

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:26.130
Your soul is still trapped here.

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:31.600
And you don't know how to 
find the path to escape.

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:35.810
You won't find the path.

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:40.780
Then tell me.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:46.540
You know that when I went missing in the 
Lost Incident, my parents searched for me.

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:49.250
And died in a traffic accident.

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:55.000
That morning I went missing, 
I had a fight with my parents.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.440
I said something horrible.

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:58.960
What did you say?

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.700
I don't remember.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:09.410
Probably about not wanting to eat what's 
on my plate or stop telling me to study.

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:12.140
But pathetically...

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:18.300
I was caught in fear, so I don't remember.

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:22.460
No matter how many times 
I try, I can't remember.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:26.280
I said something horrible to my dead parents.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:28.850
I've been living with that fact!

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:34.260
Tell me!  What did I say?

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:41.700
How am I supposed to apologize to those who 
are gone, to those I'll never see again?

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:50.610
It's not pathetic.  And 
there's no need to apologize.

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:58.620
Those who are gone haven't completely 
vanished from your life.

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:01.180
They just went ahead earlier.

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:03.560
That's what I believe.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:06.690
How spiritual.

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:09.770
Does that also apply to AIs?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:16.560
But I live my life in a way that won't 
shame them when I see them again.

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:18.110
Unlike you.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:22.080
You're saying I'm living a shameful life?

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:24.810
Currently, you are.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:26.780
What?

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:30.920
If you have time to complain, then defeat me!

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:34.070
With your duel where you burn your soul!

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:39.920
To overcome the hardships in your 
heart, you have to become stronger.

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:42.620
A duel that burns the soul.

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:48.570
Revolver, are you trying to become 
Soulburner's greatest test?

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:51.540
I have 0 cards in my hand.

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:54.570
And no monsters or cards on my field.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:59.310
This draw may end my chance to win.

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:02.250
Stop being confused, Soulburner.

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:05.950
It's not like you.

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:14.690
You know that Revolver is right.

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:18.780
Me and your parents are gone.

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:21.600
But we're always with you!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:24.380
Face forward, Soulburner!

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:29.870
That's right.  Good.

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:38.750
You're right.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:43.320
Everything that happened 
so far is a part of me!

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:45.590
That's what I lived through!

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:49.230
Here I go!

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:52.420
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:56.160 --> 00:16:00.400
I activate the banished Zeroboros's effect!

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:02.470
It Special Summons itself!

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:03.940
What?

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:10.680
And Zeroboros gains 200 ATK 
for every banished card.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:14.240
There are 11 banished cards.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:17.780
So its ATK become 5200!

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:24.400
5200 ATK now?

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:26.100
But that location...

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:31.570
If Soulburner summons a monster in an 
Extra Monster Zone next to its link...

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:34.860
...Zeroboros's banishing effect activates.

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:40.010
He's showing Soulburner no mercy.

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:42.710
What will you do, Soulburner?

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:48.180
After everything, your Zeroboros 
left me with a chance!

00:16:48.180 --> 00:16:49.490
What?

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:53.220
I activate the spell card, Burning Draw!

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:55.190
Burning Draw?

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:57.880
When there are no cards on my field...

00:16:57.880 --> 00:17:03.500
... I draw a card from my deck for each 
Link Marker that your monster has!

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:07.400
I draw four cards!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:08.870
Four?

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.180
Here I go, Revolver!

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:14.740
I activate the spell 
card, Link Fire's Return!

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:17.780
I Special Summon a Salamangreat 
from my graveyard.

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:22.670
And you take 200 damage for 
each of its Link Markers!

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:25.320
Resurrect, Heatleo!

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:28.560
It's in the Main Monster Zone.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.730
Now Revolver has 200 LP!

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:42.320
From my hand, I activate 
Salamangreat Salamandra's effect!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:47.710
I Special Summon a Salamangreat from 
my hand whose Level iis equal or less

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:50.010
than the total Link Markers on the field!

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:52.780
There are seven Link Markers on the field!

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:57.250
So I Special Summon Level 6 Salamandra!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:04.690
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:09.870
The summoning conditions are at 
least two Fire Effect Monsters!

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:12.630
Link Summon!

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:17.270
Link 4 Salamangreat Pyro Phoenix!

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:19.240
But in the current state...

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:22.280
He Link Summoned knowing it'll be banished.

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:26.910
I activate Karmacept Dragon's 
effect from my hand!

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:32.660
When you Link Summon, I can 
equip it on that monster!

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:36.220
Equip it on Pyro Phoenix?

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:39.560
When the monster equipped 
with Karmacept is banished...

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:44.030
...you take damage equal 
to your monster's ATK!

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:45.500
What?

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:52.610
Even with your counterstrategy, Zeroboros's 
effect's activation will end you, Soulburner!

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:58.340
But I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell, Salamangreat Transcendence!

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:03.020
I use one Salamangreat on the field 
to Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:10.960
Phoenix!  Throw yourself in the surging 
flames to awaken your immortal power!

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:15.430
Transcendent Link Summon!

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:21.400
Be reborn, Link 4 Salamangreat Pyro Phoenix!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.360
That's pointless!

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:29.940
Even if you reincarnate, Zeroboros's 
effect banishes all cards!

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:38.480
Using Transcendent Link Summon to avoid 
Karmacept's effect damage is impressive.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:41.950
But Karmacept has another effect.

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:48.890
When Karmacept is sent to the graveyard, 
I select a Link Monster in your graveyard.

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:55.000
I Special Summon a banished Dragon Link 
Monster that has equal or fewer Link Markers!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.870
I select Link 4 Pyro Phoenix!

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:03.540
Resurrect, Borreload Dragon!

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:08.340
Borreload resurrects at this time?

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:11.390
But I won't give up!

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:13.250
I'll face forward!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:16.100
I activate Salamandra's 
effect from my graveyard!

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:18.260
Since a Salamangreat Link Monster left the

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:22.180
field this turn, I banish 
this card from my graveyard.

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:24.340
I Special Summon a monster from my graveyard

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:28.160
with fewer Link Markers than the 
monster that left the field!

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:30.630
Resurrect, Heatleo!

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:37.500
Then it negates monsters' 
effects on the field!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:41.640
I activate Salamangreat Sanctuary!

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:49.460
Surging flame, awaken Heatleo's true 
strength with the power of purification!

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:52.120
Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:57.580
Be reborn, Link 3 Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:20:58.160 --> 00:21:02.140
Reincarnation Link Summoned 
Heatleo's effect activates!

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:07.420
Borreload's ATK become the same as 
Balelynx's in my graveyard - 500!

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:09.510
Flame Possession!

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:18.510
Here I go!  Battle!

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:22.040
Heatleo attacks Borreload!

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:24.820
Heat Soul!

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:27.820
Well done, Soulburner.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:35.630
Maybe he wanted to apologize to you.

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:09.560
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:17.010
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:24.000
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:26.970
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:34.480
The next sentimental

00:22:39.320 --> 00:22:45.740
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:52.180
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.670 --> 00:22:57.400
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.570 --> 00:23:07.760
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:13.190
Are you ready?

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:18.540
Oh oh oh

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:23.760
Are you ready?

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:30.850
Are you ready?

00:23:37.780 --> 00:23:42.350
I knew it would end like this someday.

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:45.620
And that someday is now.

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:50.640
Everything I did was to lead to this moment.

00:23:50.640 --> 00:23:53.760
There's no going back now.

00:23:53.760 --> 00:23:59.400
We fought together so that 
we'd fight each other?

00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:03.940
